			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 210000501,
					"content": "太好了…我昨天晚上可是写了一晚上，弄丢的话，我就要重写了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210000502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 210000502,
					"content": "呜哇…你有那么多烦恼吗？怎么会写一整个晚上呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210000503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 210000503,
					"content": "也…也不是有很多烦恼啦。我就只是想知道，怎么样才能变成熟啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210000504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 210000504,
					"content": "我查了很多资料，也看了很多书，但越是看书，我想不明白的事反而越多了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210000505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 210000505,
					"content": "嘿嘿，所以我就把所有不明白的问题都写进去了，希望能得到答案。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210000506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 210000506,
					"content": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，我们快点去把漂流瓶放出去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				}
			]
