					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210000604,
					"content": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，我们先回城里去吧。",
